+======================================================================================+
|                                SYSTEM.pd — Wiring                                    |
|                     Unified Relational Engine in Pure Data                           |
+======================================================================================+

RDG → MFE → Q in a clean left‑to‑right pipeline
SYSTEM_STATE as the unified container
Control‑rate flow for logic
Audio‑rate flow for flux, moderation, and Hamiltonian dynamics
Final rating as a control‑rate output
Final audio as an optional sonic representation of the RME evolution

[SYSTEM_init]
     |
     v
[loadbang]
     |
     v
[system_clock]   <-- [metro 50] or [metro 100] depending on update rate
     |
     v
+------------------+      +------------------+      +------------------+      +------------------+
|   rdg.pd         | ---> |   mfe.pd         | ---> |   qslice.pd      | ---> |   rme.pd         |
|------------------|      |------------------|      |------------------|      |------------------|
| SID_structure    |      | pos_flux         |      | slice_def        |      | hamiltonian_core |
| SID_interaction  |      | neg_flux         |      | moderation_rules |      | clifford_action  |
| SID_dynamics     |      | coupling         |      | boundary_cond    |      | memory           |
|                  |      | flux_loop        |      | slice_instance   |      | survival_score   |
+------------------+      +------------------+      +------------------+      +------------------+
       |                        |                        |                        |
       |                        |                        |                        |
       v                        v                        v                        v

+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                 SYSTEM_STATE.pd                                      |
|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| [rdg_state]      <-- from rdg.pd                                                     |
| [flux_state]     <-- from mfe.pd                                                     |
| [qslice_state]   <-- from qslice.pd                                                  |
| [rme_state]      <-- from rme.pd                                                     |
| [output_rating]  <-- final output                                                    |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+

CONTROL FLOW (control-rate)
---------------------------
[system_clock] --> [rdg.pd] --> [mfe.pd] --> [qslice.pd] --> [rme.pd]
     |               |           |             |              |
     v               v           v             v              v
[SYSTEM_STATE] <--------------------------------------------------

AUDIO FLOW (audio-rate)
-----------------------
[rdg_audio~] --> [mfe_audio~] --> [qslice_audio~] --> [rme_audio~]
     |               |               |                 |
     v               v               v                 v
[snapshot~] --> control-rate integration into SYSTEM_STATE

RDG.pd INPUTS/OUTPUTS
---------------------
IN:  [system_clock], [rdg_state]
OUT: [rdg_state], [rdg_audio~]

MFE.pd INPUTS/OUTPUTS
---------------------
IN:  [rdg_state], [flux_state]
OUT: [flux_state], [mfe_audio~]

QSLICE.pd INPUTS/OUTPUTS
------------------------
IN:  [flux_state], [qslice_state]
OUT: [qslice_state], [qslice_audio~]

RME.pd INPUTS/OUTPUTS
---------------------
IN:  [rdg_state], [flux_state], [qslice_state], [rme_state]
OUT: [rme_state], [output_rating], [rme_audio~]

FINAL OUTPUT
------------
[rme_audio~] --> [dac~]
[output_rating] --> [number] or [print]

SYSTEM CONTROL OBJECTS
----------------------
[loadbang]
[metro]
[bang]
[trigger]
[spigot]
[select]
[list]
[text]
[pack]/[unpack]

SYSTEM AUDIO OBJECTS
--------------------
[osc~]
[phasor~]
[*~]
[+~]
[expr~]
[clip~]
[snapshot~]
[env~]
[delwrite~]
[delread~]
